---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const VERSION = 'imprint_v0.1';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Imprint — Seald"
  description="Legal imprint for the Seald website and e-signature service: who operates it, how to reach them, and the regulatory details published for visitors and users."
>
  <main id="main" class="legal">
    <article>
      <header>
        <section class="legal-banner">
          <p><strong>Draft — not legal advice.</strong> This document is published in good faith as Seald's working draft. It has not yet been reviewed by counsel and may change before becoming binding. If you are reviewing this on behalf of a customer, please contact <a href="mailto:privacy@seald.nromomentum.com">privacy@seald.nromomentum.com</a> for the countersigned production version.</p>
          <p class="meta">Version: <code>{VERSION}</code> · Last updated: <code>2026-04-30</code></p>
        </section>
        <h1>Imprint / Impressum</h1>
        <p>This page identifies the operator of the Seald service.</p>
      </header>

      <section id="operator">
        <h2>1. Operator</h2>
        <dl>
          <dt>Operator</dt><dd>Eliran Azulay, an individual resident in Israel, trading as "Seald" (no company)</dd>
          <dt>Postal address</dt><dd>Chlenov 24, Tel Aviv-Yafo 6604806, Israel</dd>
          <dt>Legal and privacy</dt><dd><a href="mailto:privacy@seald.nromomentum.com">privacy@seald.nromomentum.com</a></dd>
          <dt>Support</dt><dd><a href="mailto:support@seald.nromomentum.com">support@seald.nromomentum.com</a></dd>
        </dl>
        <p>Seald is not a company. If Seald is later transferred to a company, this page and our Terms will be updated with notice.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="vat">
        <h2>2. VAT and tax registration</h2>
        <p>Seald is currently a free service and is not registered for VAT or sales tax. Registration details will be published here if and when required.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="legal-contact">
        <h2>3. Legal notices</h2>
        <p>Service of process and legal notices should be sent by email to <a href="mailto:privacy@seald.nromomentum.com">privacy@seald.nromomentum.com</a>, with a copy by post to Seald (Eliran Azulay), Chlenov 24, Tel Aviv-Yafo 6604806, Israel.</p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
